    "description": "Read operation. Retrieve all required pages before reporting complete totals. Returns a single workflow-type-entity record by id. This is a v2 native-entity endpoint served from the `/v2/api/entity` base and authenticated with a Bearer token.\n\nThe `workflow_id` path segment selects the workflow type (entity key `le_workflow-type-entity-{workflow_id}`); `record_id` is the record to fetch. The successful response is a **flat object** of the record's fields — it is not wrapped in a `data` envelope. The available fields depend on the workflow type's configuration; custom fields are returned under both the `custom_data` alias and the `le_workflow-type-entity-{workflow_id}_custom_data` object.\n\nThe trailing path segment is the **data level** (how deeply related records are loaded); it is inert for a single-record fetch and is not a response-format extension.",
